@startuml "Suivi des ventes - Organisateur"

title Consultation du dashboard de ventes

actor "Organisateur" as Organizer
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Analytics Service" as AnalyticsSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Suivi des ventes ==
Organizer -> Frontend: Consulter dashboard
Frontend -> API: GET /api/organizer/dashboard
API -> Auth: Vérifier rôle ORGANIZER
Auth --> API: organizer verified

API -> AnalyticsSvc: getOrganizerDashboard(organizerId)
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT events WHERE organizerId=?
DB --> AnalyticsSvc: organizer events

AnalyticsSvc -> DB: SELECT orders WITH tickets WHERE event_id IN (?)
DB --> AnalyticsSvc: sales data

AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: Calculate metrics
note right: Total revenue, tickets sold, conversion rate, etc.

AnalyticsSvc --> API: dashboard data
API --> Frontend: analytics data
Frontend --> Organizer: Dashboard avec KPIs

@enduml